  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is decreased degradation of the ecosystem and strengthened sustainability and improved well-being of local populations in the Sud and Grand Anse Departments of Haiti. The project builds upons results achieved through preious UN Environment projects in the south of Haiti</narrative>
  </description>
